# WarriorCastSplash (20449, its shipped skills), every draw 0, 100 away from the character. Its
# first hit finds it hating no one, so it only takes the Warrior's hate; the second, by the
# character it now hates most from closer than 200, also wants its ranged DD magic (4033) on
# itself, weight 1000000.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.WarriorBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.Warrior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorCastSplash.WarriorCastSplash
npc wisp 20449 Monster 100 0 0 skill SELF_RANGE_DD_MAGIC 4033 1

hit wisp 22
  desires wisp attack(player)=275
hit wisp 22
  desires wisp attack(player)=550 cast(wisp,4033,move)=1000000
